{"type":"message","id":"ea0150d7","parentId":"1e420c31","timestamp":"2026-03-14T21:33:58.197Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is showing me a cron job status for \"Process Briefs\" that runs every hour at :25 to process daily brief content fetched from @intothecryptoverse YouTube channel. They're asking me to return my summary as plain text.\n\nLooking at the context:\n1. This is an automated cron job that was already set up (job ID: a0036b1a-bb1b-428f-a028-06ab983a1287)\n2. It runs every hour at :25 UTC/Asia/Riyadh time\n3. The job processes brief content fetched from the Telegram channel @intothecryptoverse\n4. Current time is 12:33 AM on March 15th, 2026\n\nThe user seems to be asking for a summary of what this cron job does and its current status. Let me provide that information."},{"type":"text","text":"# Cron Job Summary - Process Briefs\n\n## What It Does 📋\nThis automated job runs **every hour at :25** (e.g., 1:25, 2:25 AM) to process the daily brief content fetched from @intothecryptoverse's Telegram channel.\n\n## Job Details 🔧\n- **Job ID:** `a0036b1a-bb1b-428f-a028-06ab983a1287`\n- **Name:** Process Briefs - @:25\n- **Schedule:** Every hour at minute 25\n- **Runtime:** Asia/Riyadh timezone\n\n## Workflow 🔄\n```\nFetch Briefs (at :10) → [This Job] Process & Analyze (at :25)\n                     ↑                                    ↓\n                     └────────────────────┬───────────────────┘\n                                         │\n                                      Every hour\n```\n\n## Current Status ✅\n- **Last Run:** 3 minutes ago (at 12:25 AM)\n- **Next Run:** At 1:25 AM (in ~52 minutes)\n- **Status:** Active and running on schedule\n\n## Purpose 🎯\nThis is part of a two-stage automation pipeline:\n1. **Fetch Briefs** - Downloads content from @intothecryptoverse at :10 past each hour\n2. **Process Briefs** (this job) - Analyzes, categorizes, and stores the brief content for your daily brief tracker\n\nThe processed data likely feeds into your GitHub Pages dashboard or other tracking systems you're building for market analysis."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen3-5-9b","model":"qwen3.5-9b-claude-4.6-opus-reasoning-distilled","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773523989437}}
